<p>Let's make the same decisions for each of these combinations as well to =
continue extending the state space tree. Remember that if any combination h=
as a sum equal to 4 or exceeding 4, we stop extending those combinations. T=
hese two conditions are effectively our termination conditions:</p>
<figure class=3D"py-1"><div style=3D"display: flex; justify-content: center=
